  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.88 - IncludeMembers awareness for AM004, AM006, and AM011\n- AM011 no longer reports a required destination property that an IncludeMembers member supplies (was an Error-severity false positive that broke consumer builds)\n- AM004 treats a source member consumed by IncludeMembers as mapped instead of dropped\n- AM006 recognises destination members supplied by an included member\n- Included members resolve directly and through AutoMapper's flattening convention; unresolvable selectors fail closed\n- No analyzer rule ID or severity changes",
